{"real": false, "dur": 101.6, "sent": [{"start": 0.4, "end": 3.48, "text": "New Practical Chinese Reader, Book 1, Lesson 3.", "words": [{"w": "New", "s": 0.4}, {"w": "Practical", "s": 0.78}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 1.17}, {"w": "Reader,", "s": 1.55}, {"w": "Book", "s": 1.94}, {"w": "1,", "s": 2.32}, {"w": "Lesson", "s": 2.71}, {"w": "3.", "s": 3.09}]}, {"start": 3.83, "end": 6.9, "text": "The title is “What country is she from?”", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 3.83}, {"w": "title", "s": 4.21}, {"w": "is", "s": 4.6}, {"w": "“What", "s": 4.98}, {"w": "country", "s": 5.37}, {"w": "is", "s": 5.75}, {"w": "she", "s": 6.13}, {"w": "from?”", "s": 6.52}]}, {"start": 7.25, "end": 11.48, "text": "The book gives you a text, some notes and pronunciation practice.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 7.25}, {"w": "book", "s": 7.64}, {"w": "gives", "s": 8.02}, {"w": "you", "s": 8.41}, {"w": "a", "s": 8.79}, {"w": "text,", "s": 9.18}, {"w": "some", "s": 9.56}, {"w": "notes", "s": 9.95}, {"w": "and", "s": 10.33}, {"w": "pronunciation", "s": 10.72}, {"w": "practice.", "s": 11.1}]}, {"start": 11.83, "end": 16.83, "text": "No situations, no task, and this lesson doesn’t even have a grammar section.", "words": [{"w": "No", "s": 11.83}, {"w": "situations,", "s": 12.22}, {"w": "no", "s": 12.6}, {"w": "task,", "s": 12.99}, {"w": "and", "s": 13.37}, {"w": "this", "s": 13.76}, {"w": "lesson", "s": 14.14}, {"w": "doesn’t", "s": 14.53}, {"w": "even", "s": 14.91}, {"w": "have", "s": 15.3}, {"w": "a", "s": 15.68}, {"w": "grammar", "s": 16.07}, {"w": "section.", "s": 16.45}]}, {"start": 17.18, "end": 20.65, "text": "So I start from what the text actually does.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 17.18}, {"w": "I", "s": 17.57}, {"w": "start", "s": 17.95}, {"w": "from", "s": 18.34}, {"w": "what", "s": 18.72}, {"w": "the", "s": 19.11}, {"w": "text", "s": 19.49}, {"w": "actually", "s": 19.88}, {"w": "does.", "s": 20.26}]}, {"start": 21.0, "end": 22.92, "text": "Look at the first dialogue.", "words": [{"w": "Look", "s": 21.0}, {"w": "at", "s": 21.38}, {"w": "the", "s": 21.77}, {"w": "first", "s": 22.15}, {"w": "dialogue.", "s": 22.53}]}, {"start": 23.27, "end": 25.19, "text": "Someone asks who that is.", "words": [{"w": "Someone", "s": 23.27}, {"w": "asks", "s": 23.65}, {"w": "who", "s": 24.04}, {"w": "that", "s": 24.42}, {"w": "is.", "s": 24.81}]}, {"start": 25.54, "end": 27.47, "text": "The answer: that’s our teacher.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 25.54}, {"w": "answer:", "s": 25.93}, {"w": "that’s", "s": 26.31}, {"w": "our", "s": 26.7}, {"w": "teacher.", "s": 27.08}]}, {"start": 27.82, "end": 30.12, "text": "Then: what country is she from?", "words": [{"w": "Then:", "s": 27.82}, {"w": "what", "s": 28.2}, {"w": "country", "s": 28.58}, {"w": "is", "s": 28.97}, {"w": "she", "s": 29.35}, {"w": "from?", "s": 29.74}]}, {"start": 30.47, "end": 31.24, "text": "She’s Chinese.", "words": [{"w": "She’s", "s": 30.47}, {"w": "Chinese.", "s": 30.86}]}, {"start": 31.59, "end": 34.28, "text": "And then: all our teachers are Chinese.", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 31.59}, {"w": "then:", "s": 31.98}, {"w": "all", "s": 32.36}, {"w": "our", "s": 32.75}, {"w": "teachers", "s": 33.13}, {"w": "are", "s": 33.52}, {"w": "Chinese.", "s": 33.9}]}, {"start": 34.63, "end": 42.33, "text": "From that short dialogue, I can identify two things learners need to do: identify someone and say where they’re from.", "words": [{"w": "From", "s": 34.63}, {"w": "that", "s": 35.02}, {"w": "short", "s": 35.4}, {"w": "dialogue,", "s": 35.79}, {"w": "I", "s": 36.17}, {"w": "can", "s": 36.56}, {"w": "identify", "s": 36.94}, {"w": "two", "s": 37.33}, {"w": "things", "s": 37.71}, {"w": "learners", "s": 38.1}, {"w": "need", "s": 38.48}, {"w": "to", "s": 38.87}, {"w": "do:", "s": 39.25}, {"w": "identify", "s": 39.63}, {"w": "someone", "s": 40.02}, {"w": "and", "s": 40.4}, {"w": "say", "s": 40.79}, {"w": "where", "s": 41.17}, {"w": "they’re", "s": 41.56}, {"w": "from.", "s": 41.94}]}, {"start": 42.68, "end": 44.22, "text": "Next, the linguistic goals.", "words": [{"w": "Next,", "s": 42.68}, {"w": "the", "s": 43.06}, {"w": "linguistic", "s": 43.45}, {"w": "goals.", "s": 43.83}]}, {"start": 44.57, "end": 48.41, "text": "The verb “to be,” and how to make it negative.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 44.57}, {"w": "verb", "s": 44.95}, {"w": "“to", "s": 45.33}, {"w": "be,”", "s": 45.72}, {"w": "and", "s": 46.1}, {"w": "how", "s": 46.49}, {"w": "to", "s": 46.87}, {"w": "make", "s": 47.26}, {"w": "it", "s": 47.64}, {"w": "negative.", "s": 48.03}]}, {"start": 48.76, "end": 50.3, "text": "The question word “who.”", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 48.76}, {"w": "question", "s": 49.15}, {"w": "word", "s": 49.53}, {"w": "“who.”", "s": 49.92}]}, {"start": 50.65, "end": 52.96, "text": "The nationality pattern: country plus “person.”", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 50.65}, {"w": "nationality", "s": 51.03}, {"w": "pattern:", "s": 51.42}, {"w": "country", "s": 51.8}, {"w": "plus", "s": 52.19}, {"w": "“person.”", "s": 52.57}]}, {"start": 53.31, "end": 54.46, "text": "The word “all.”", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 53.31}, {"w": "word", "s": 53.69}, {"w": "“all.”", "s": 54.08}]}, {"start": 54.81, "end": 62.89, "text": "Learners have already seen it in Lesson 2, but they won’t study where it goes in a sentence until Lesson 7.", "words": [{"w": "Learners", "s": 54.81}, {"w": "have", "s": 55.2}, {"w": "already", "s": 55.58}, {"w": "seen", "s": 55.97}, {"w": "it", "s": 56.35}, {"w": "in", "s": 56.73}, {"w": "Lesson", "s": 57.12}, {"w": "2,", "s": 57.5}, {"w": "but", "s": 57.89}, {"w": "they", "s": 58.27}, {"w": "won’t", "s": 58.66}, {"w": "study", "s": 59.04}, {"w": "where", "s": 59.43}, {"w": "it", "s": 59.81}, {"w": "goes", "s": 60.2}, {"w": "in", "s": 60.58}, {"w": "a", "s": 60.97}, {"w": "sentence", "s": 61.35}, {"w": "until", "s": 61.73}, {"w": "Lesson", "s": 62.12}, {"w": "7.", "s": 62.5}]}, {"start": 63.24, "end": 67.47, "text": "So for now, they just encounter it, without practising it separately.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 63.24}, {"w": "for", "s": 63.62}, {"w": "now,", "s": 64.01}, {"w": "they", "s": 64.39}, {"w": "just", "s": 64.78}, {"w": "encounter", "s": 65.16}, {"w": "it,", "s": 65.55}, {"w": "without", "s": 65.93}, {"w": "practising", "s": 66.32}, {"w": "it", "s": 66.7}, {"w": "separately.", "s": 67.08}]}, {"start": 67.82, "end": 72.82, "text": "And one sound: the negative word changes its tone before a fourth tone.", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 67.82}, {"w": "one", "s": 68.2}, {"w": "sound:", "s": 68.59}, {"w": "the", "s": 68.97}, {"w": "negative", "s": 69.36}, {"w": "word", "s": 69.74}, {"w": "changes", "s": 70.13}, {"w": "its", "s": 70.51}, {"w": "tone", "s": 70.9}, {"w": "before", "s": 71.28}, {"w": "a", "s": 71.67}, {"w": "fourth", "s": 72.05}, {"w": "tone.", "s": 72.43}]}, {"start": 73.17, "end": 77.02, "text": "So “is” and “is not” are said with different tones.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 73.17}, {"w": "“is”", "s": 73.55}, {"w": "and", "s": 73.94}, {"w": "“is", "s": 74.32}, {"w": "not”", "s": 74.71}, {"w": "are", "s": 75.09}, {"w": "said", "s": 75.48}, {"w": "with", "s": 75.86}, {"w": "different", "s": 76.25}, {"w": "tones.", "s": 76.63}]}, {"start": 77.37, "end": 78.9, "text": "Notice the change here.", "words": [{"w": "Notice", "s": 77.37}, {"w": "the", "s": 77.75}, {"w": "change", "s": 78.13}, {"w": "here.", "s": 78.52}]}, {"start": 79.25, "end": 81.95, "text": "It’s the same grid as in French.", "words": [{"w": "It’s", "s": 79.25}, {"w": "the", "s": 79.64}, {"w": "same", "s": 80.02}, {"w": "grid", "s": 80.41}, {"w": "as", "s": 80.79}, {"w": "in", "s": 81.18}, {"w": "French.", "s": 81.56}]}, {"start": 82.3, "end": 86.53, "text": "Only the content is new, and everything comes from the book.", "words": [{"w": "Only", "s": 82.3}, {"w": "the", "s": 82.68}, {"w": "content", "s": 83.07}, {"w": "is", "s": 83.45}, {"w": "new,", "s": 83.83}, {"w": "and", "s": 84.22}, {"w": "everything", "s": 84.6}, {"w": "comes", "s": 84.99}, {"w": "from", "s": 85.37}, {"w": "the", "s": 85.76}, {"w": "book.", "s": 86.14}]}, {"start": 86.88, "end": 92.65, "text": "I keep the same basic structure, but adapt the goals, exercises and situations to Chinese.", "words": [{"w": "I", "s": 86.88}, {"w": "keep", "s": 87.26}, {"w": "the", "s": 87.65}, {"w": "same", "s": 88.03}, {"w": "basic", "s": 88.42}, {"w": "structure,", "s": 88.8}, {"w": "but", "s": 89.18}, {"w": "adapt", "s": 89.57}, {"w": "the", "s": 89.95}, {"w": "goals,", "s": 90.34}, {"w": "exercises", "s": 90.72}, {"w": "and", "s": 91.11}, {"w": "situations", "s": 91.49}, {"w": "to", "s": 91.88}, {"w": "Chinese.", "s": 92.26}]}, {"start": 93.0, "end": 96.84, "text": "And the textbook determines what learners are expected to know.", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 93.0}, {"w": "the", "s": 93.38}, {"w": "textbook", "s": 93.77}, {"w": "determines", "s": 94.15}, {"w": "what", "s": 94.53}, {"w": "learners", "s": 94.92}, {"w": "are", "s": 95.3}, {"w": "expected", "s": 95.69}, {"w": "to", "s": 96.07}, {"w": "know.", "s": 96.46}]}, {"start": 97.19, "end": 100.65, "text": "That’s how the French template becomes a Chinese one.", "words": [{"w": "That’s", "s": 97.19}, {"w": "how", "s": 97.58}, {"w": "the", "s": 97.96}, {"w": "French", "s": 98.35}, {"w": "template", "s": 98.73}, {"w": "becomes", "s": 99.12}, {"w": "a", "s": 99.5}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 99.88}, {"w": "one.", "s": 100.27}]}]}